{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123279","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123279/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123279/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123279/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123279","id":5376870964,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCjGWAg","number":123279,"title":"Add BatchRename support to FileSystem dock","user":{"login":"kushagra10025","id":53115703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTE1NzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53115703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025","html_url":"https://github.com/kushagra10025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-07T16:01:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T16:05:59Z","closed_at":"2026-09-07T16:02:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123279","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123279","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123279.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123279.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5633\r\n\r\nCurrently the FileSystem dock only allows rename of one file/folder at a time, this becomes cumbersome for big projects.\r\nThe SceneDock has long supported this functionality (via https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/69087 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/15928)\r\n\r\nThis PR also generalizes `RenameDialog` from scene-dock specific into a reusable `BatchRenameDialog`\r\n\r\nBefore the PR:\r\n<img width=\"430\" height=\"181\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-07 204356\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbb7e14a-b42d-4bf6-96d4-6b09141ec4fb\" />\r\n\r\nWith the PR:\r\n<img width=\"534\" height=\"272\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-07 205212\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d8fdd73-2a9e-4dea-86c0-c8497ebda838\" />\r\n\r\nVideo:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2774571c-2cb2-4942-ac6a-355efccfe07c\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- **AI disclosure - Not used**\r\n- Folders are intentionally **not** supported by FileSystem BatchRename.\r\n- MenuEntry is hidden for selections having a folder, and will show a warning if triggered via the Shortcut.\r\n- Is Undo-able\r\n- In my tests, other functionality remain at par with previous RenameDialog system\r\n- Improvements I wish to do/see in the RenameDialog (For this will raise a proposal - here just for note)\r\n  - Show all files to be renamed in preview - Similar to how PowerRename does it (SS below)\r\n  - Add similar functionality to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/69087 as an additional option\r\n<img width=\"725\" height=\"235\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/329c4450-4a93-477c-876b-1f40404f3c1f\" />\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reaction